--- /dev/null
+++ b/vendor/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# HaveAPI client archive
+
+`haveapi-client-f94e65e35166a0bf8048a27c9d57c7d36957d65b.tgz` is the normal
+frontend dependency, copied unchanged from an npm pack of the committed HaveAPI
+JavaScript client. It is not an npm registry release.
+
+See [client provenance and updates](../docs/design/HAVEAPI_CLIENT.md) for the
+source revision, build commands and installation contract.
+[The manifest](haveapi-client-provenance.json) records the complete packed file
+inventory, source/toolchain, archive SHA-256 and npm integrity. The archive
+includes HaveAPI's MIT `LICENSE.txt` and copyright notice. Keep that license when
+redistributing the package.
